<title>NEW ZEALAND: POLL-Reuters survey of NZ CPI, FPI, retail data.</title>
<headline>POLL-Reuters survey of NZ CPI, FPI, retail data.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following New Zealand indicators are scheduled for release next week. Times are GMT.</p>
<p>DAY TIME   INDICATOR	     PERIOD     AVG F/CAST   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Tue 2245   Consumers Price Index</p>
<p>	     Core inflation	June qtr   +0.33 pct   +0.22 pct</p>
<p>	     Core inflation	June yr    +1.50 pct   +1.97 pct</p>
<p>	     Headline inflation  June qtr   +0.14 pct    -0.3 pct</p>
<p>	     Headline inflation  June yr    +1.13 pct    +1.8 pct</p>
<p>Tue 2245 a Food Price Index    June	 +0.13 pct    -0.8 pct</p>
<p>	   b Food Price Index    June year  +1.98 pct    +1.7 pct</p>
<p>Thu 2245   Retail trade</p>
<p>	   c (s/adj, mth-mth)    May	  -2.61 pct    +7.9 pct</p>
<p>	   d (total actual pct)  May yr     -3.53 pct    +2.9 pct</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
